{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"Weil代数"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“Weil 代数”"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p><span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/Weil+algebra\" title=\"nLab 页面 [https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/Weil+algebra]\">nLab 页面</a></span>\nLie 代数 $\\mathfrak{g}$ 的 Weil 代数可视为切 Lie $2$-代数 $T\\mathfrak g$ 的 Chevalley–Eilenberg 代数.</p>\n"}}